      "created_at": null,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/568d8f23edb28368b140be1c6c0fee24b43252d7",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "31e586a2c7c513a7d6dfe60e39d6b297e97e3daa",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/31e586a2c7c513a7d6dfe60e39d6b297e97e3daa"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 31e586a2c7c513a7d6dfe60e39d6b297e97e3daa\nparent f89bd7f5a5843e84ae66be2bde791f0a2ae5dd41\nauthor optout21 <13562139+optout21@users.noreply.github.com> 1793261176 +0100\ncommitter optout21 <13562139+optout21@users.noreply.github.com> 1793626260 +0100\n\ntest: interface_http: Fix for case when a response doesn't arrive in one recv\n\nSeveral checks read a response with one recv() call (recv_raw(), up to\n1024 bytes) and assumed it held the whole HTTP response. TCP does not\nguarantee this: on a slow or loaded machine a response can arrive split\nacross several reads, so the check sees only the status line or headers\nand fails.\n\nThe loops in check_pipelining and check_slow_read_throttle had a related\nproblem. They counted \"HTTP/1.1 200\" markers in each read separately, so\na marker split across two reads was never counted, and the loop waited\nuntil the socket timed out.\n\nAdd BitcoinHTTPConnection.recv_responses(count), which keeps reading\nuntil `count` complete responses (headers plus Content-Length body) have\narrived, or the server closes the connection. Use it everywhere a full\nresponse is expected, and replace the counting loops with explicit\nassertions on the result.\n\nrecv_raw() is kept for the timeout checks, where a single blocking read\nis the intended behaviour.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCgAdFiEEmuHXOVRjWiwQgEZAHancOgcdFYIFAmrokJgACgkQHancOgcd\nFYJrbAv+PhnwlsZYUS31WIncgsO0+2w+71XacrregF8y1Rog8kigu6QrUACpko7a\nPxww9XnTdxHadXQm8OuExMilhe9DT6ELCYrDRwCCg2psXRTPt3mLxHSZqCYEVDzZ\nZQuJriN5JhxIGUJjKfH6rgg0lCl6FvWCZrITRPgjJjwH7hLFkcXZqYxlKdu7gS7K\np4gNg3MhTeJWmXmb7gZ0ASWBAjt8PU4bb8/IAScnnQXSHvCPoOD4bpZoa2ApPhAS\nn3EShUJSXyK9TU0bVNLFQateJCFRwbUld5wz3G+qU86AWcfTtr1DkdUagrZ8Bipq\napvCsPCY8Xo5JPASH1RBAtmyXBTwEvsqhP9Oc0qVooIjdlDhm9bveeo7JDK7yDD5\nGl1o4CjHZZ1eFkIZpoB+Axo/DcQhPwJy9t/XsqG9qRxHlh/oUijoEwhCnFq5vYhQ\nxciF7RuQdyvHxxdclFLhNXtdml1C6e7qqyQ2z/XZ2vdLb5ijK8kd5O3V7kyS/dBG\nkPrgUeO2\n=1J1P\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
